WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.067
Counting in the garden

2
00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:13.167
Hello, friends! Grandma's garden is full of flowers. Let's count each one just once.

3
00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:30.200
One, two, three, four, five, six. The last number we say is six, so there are six flowers.
